o rigid packages, so it scales with your team. Everything runs through the same UK service desk that handles your day-to-day tickets, so there is no separate team to chase. Across 2025 our average first response time was 9 minutes and our average resolution time was 6 hours, measured across every ticket we handled."},{"k":"u5","type":"u","label":"Link: Back to Cyber Security","default":"/cyber-security/"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"Back to Cyber Security"},{"k":"i7","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-email-security-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-email-security-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-email-security-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-email-security-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Glowing envelope-shaped lights against a dark background\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-email-security-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Cyber Security"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Email Security"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"What’s included"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Advanced anti-phishing and anti-spam"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Malware and attachment scanning"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"Impersonation and spoofing protection"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Link protection and safe attachments"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Domain authentication (SPF, DKIM, DMARC)"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Continuous monitoring"}]}